identical particles, which

144
00:07:56,360 --> 00:07:59,590
classically, really
are kind of not

145
00:07:59,590 --> 00:08:03,090
a very well-defined concept,
but quantum-mechanically, they

146
00:08:03,090 --> 00:08:06,450
are very precisely defined,
what identical particles mean.

147
00:08:06,450 --> 00:08:09,270
And there are two classes--
fermions and bosons--

148
00:08:09,270 --> 00:08:15,310
and how even if there's no
interaction between them,

149
00:08:15,310 --> 00:08:20,430
quantum statistics leads to
unusual behavior for quantum

150
00:08:20,430 --> 00:08:24,260
systems of identical particles,
very distinct for fermions

151
00:08:24,260 --> 00:08:26,330
and for bosons.

